      "content": "reinstallation or migration... i dont even know if there's a backup to restore from. it just feels like the hardware is reaching its end of life. like, if the system is this broken and the errors are just constant, what's the point of keeping the power on? isn't it more logical to just... initiate a complete shutdown when the system is no longer useful?",
